eye-contact-co-processing-at-the-speed-of-light-lines-6 = cons "## 3. Two Nervous Systems, Directly Coupled" (cons "" (cons "Compare direct optical coupling against symbolic communication such as speech or text. Speech passes through a deep chain of lossy encoding layers: internal neural state $\to$ lexical selection $\to$ motor articulation $\to$ acoustic pressure wave $\to$ cochlear transduction $\to$ phonological and semantic decoding. Every abstraction layer widens the observer's preimage fiber, pooling distinct internal states into indistinguishable surface tokens (`neuro/eye-contact.hypercubical`, `ec-direct-refines-symbolic`, `ec-abstraction-erases`)." (cons "" (cons "Direct visual observation eliminates symbolic indirection. Internal neural activity manifests immediately in ocular and periocular motor output, modulates the ambient photon field reflected from the eye and face, and transduces straight into the observer's exposed retinal tissue through a single physical transformation." (cons "" nil)))))
